# T105: a package that does not match its signed hash is refused with the three parts, and the reader is unchanged.
# scenario demo
# server broken app-04
# expect-unchanged
# expect-no-file applications/app-04.bin
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap appRow 3
waitfor detailState Not installed
tap actionInstall
waitfor resultText
expect resultText E-ENT-15
expect resultReader not changed
expect resultTodo Do not install this package
shot @OUT@/23-refused.png
tap ok
waitfor appRow
quit
